# **Credentials never belong in this repo.**
# Verified with `git check-ignore`, not by reading this file.
**/.credentials.json
**/.claude.json
**/.claude.json.known-good
.cli-config/
.claude/
*.credentials
.env
.env.*

# **Run artifacts NEVER live here.** They carry human baselines, winning
# routes and solver notes.
evidence/
runs/
clean_rollouts*/
ccarc*-sweep*/
*.jsonl
*.jsonl.gz
trace.state.json
shared_card.json
scorecard.json

# build artifacts -- `pip install .` leaves a full copy of the package under
# build/, which a commit would otherwise ship a second time.
build/
dist/
*.whl

# scratch
.pytest_cache/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/
paper/

# **ARC-AGI-2 run artifacts carry real puzzle content.** A workspace holds the
# task's own train pairs, rendered grids, the solver's candidate outputs and its
# notes. None of it may be committed. Verified with `git check-ignore`.
cc_runs/
**/.ccarc/
**/task/
**/solution/
**/_pkg/
result.json
summary.json
initial_prompt.md
